    {
      "id": "hosted-modern-20260924",
      "label": {
        "en": "Hosted runs · September 24 judges",
        "zh": "托管模型实测 · 9 月 24 日评委组"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "New audio-video evaluations and the existing Qwen3.8 run, using Gemini 3.8 Flash, Qwen3.8-Omni-Flash and GPT-5.6-Sol as judges. Candidate interfaces differ from the paper runs, so this cohort remains separate.",
        "zh": "新增音视频实测及此前的 Qwen3.8 运行，统一使用 Gemini 3.8 Flash、Qwen3.8-Omni-Flash 和 GPT-5.6-Sol 评分。候选模型输入接口与论文运行存在差异，故单独列组。"
      },
      "notes": {
        "en": "All 128 gold-positive responses are generated even when the model predicts NO. Temperature 0.3, top-p 1, output limit 8,192 tokens. Both media tracks end at the query boundary. Every non-empty response has three judge scores; no same-family exclusion is applied. Classification uses exact label parsing: extra explanation counts as invalid.",
        "zh": "全部 128 条应回应样本均强制生成回答，包括模型预测 NO 的情况。温度 0.3、top-p 1、输出上限 8,192 token，音视频均在查询边界截断。每条非空回答有三份评分，不剔除同家族评委。分类题严格解析标签，附加解释文字计为格式无效。"
      },
      "samples": {
        "who": 2000,
        "when": 200,
        "gold_positive": 128
      },
      "source": {
        "label": {
          "en": "Per-item results and settings",
          "zh": "逐样本结果与设置"
        },
        "url": "https://github.com/MAC-AutoML/SocialOmni/tree/main/evaluation/results/modern-panel-20260924"
      }
    },
