      "notes": {
        "en": "The 200 interaction items are video_0001–video_0200. Judges: GPT-4o, Gemini 2.5 Pro and Qwen3-Omni. All three scores are required. The always-YES baseline reaches 64% When accuracy. These metrics describe separate abilities, not an overall score.",
        "zh": "交互样本为 video_0001–video_0200。固定评委为 GPT-4o、Gemini 2.5 Pro、Qwen3-Omni，每条回答要求三份完整评分。始终预测 YES 的 When 准确率为 64%。各指标衡量不同能力，不合成为总分。"
      },
