      "description": {
        "en": "Qwen3.8-Omni-Flash in non-thinking mode on the v3 item lists. GPT-5.6-Sol replaces GPT-4o as a judge; the other judges are Gemini 2.5 Pro and original Qwen3-Omni. This is a separate evaluation group, not the paper’s original judge panel.",
        "zh": "使用 v3 样本列表补测 Qwen3.8-Omni-Flash，关闭思考模式。评委 GPT-4o 替换为 GPT-5.6-Sol，另外两位为 Gemini 2.5 Pro 和原版 Qwen3-Omni。本组独立展示，不属于论文原始评委组结果。"
      },
