      "samples": {
        "who": 2000,
        "when": 200,
        "gold_positive": 128
      },
      "notes": {
        "en": "Candidate settings: temperature 0.3, top-p 1, output limit 8,192 tokens. Audio and video end at the query boundary. All three judges score each of the 128 non-empty responses; no partial-panel average is used. The primary paper’s exact preprocessing and API envelopes have not been established for this run.",
        "zh": "候选模型设置：温度 0.3、top-p 1、输出上限 8,192 token，音视频均在查询边界截断。128 条非空回答均由三位评委评分，不使用缺少评委的平均分。本次运行尚未确认与论文原始预处理及接口请求完全一致。"
      }
    }
